│ Help                                   │
│                                        │
│ Navigation                             │
│   tab        Focus next panel          │
│   shift+tab  Focus previous panel      │
│   up, k      Move up                   │
│   down, j    Move down                 │
│   g, home    Go to top                 │
│   G, end     Go to bottom              │
│   pgup, b    Page up                   │
│   pgdown, f  Page down                 │
│   left, h    Collapse / up to parent   │
│   right, l   Expand / into first child │
│   ctrl+d     Half page down            │
│   ctrl+u     Half page up              │
│                                        │
│ General                                │
│   ?          Toggle help               │
│   q, ctrl+c  Quit                      │
│   enter      Select                    │
│   ctrl+r     Reload                    │
│                                        │
│ Filter                                 │
│   /          Filter                    │
│                                        │
│ Diagrams                               │
│   [          Previous diagram          │
│   ]          Next diagram              │
│   o          Open diagram              │
│   y          Copy diagram source       │
│                                        │
│ Locales                                │
│   L          Cycle language            │
│   e          Show English              │
